    "posts": [
      {
        "id": 2899266,
        "name": "Malakye Appleton",
        "username": "Malakye_Appleton",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/malakye_appleton/{size}/388836_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-07-09T04:10:36.720Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As I’ve been planning to get back into EVE online I decided to build myself a desktop application to track targets, systems and more. Then I thought, why not share it for free and even the playing field.</p>\n<p>Its runs on Mac and Windows (though until I get my signature situated again the Windows version will give you a warning, just click through it. It’s not harmful, I just have a glitch in my Azure system that notorizes my software and it will take a few days to get resolved.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://cryptocrow.io/evehunter\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/d/4/6/d46ce80151aa981ec5ec13f2e579a488ce189d48.png\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"81838D\" width=\"70\" height=\"67\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://cryptocrow.io/evehunter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">CryptoCrow.io</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://cryptocrow.io/evehunter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">CryptoCrow.io | Cardano, Crypto &amp; AI Insights</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Deep dives into Cardano, DeFi strategies, AI developments, and the future of decentralized tech.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>I look forward to any feedback or even improvement ideas.</p>\n<p>Fly safe o7!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "posts_count": 3,
        "updated_at": "2026-07-09T04:10:36.720Z",
